{"decision":"edit", "issues":[{"quote":"camera is already sliding steadily along the road", "problem":"The visible motion is a rightward shift of the view with leftward drift of scene elements; 'sliding along the road' is not established."}, {"quote":"dark silhouettes of pedestrians stand near the entrance", "problem":"A dark pedestrian silhouette is visibly walking leftward near the snowbank, so describing only standing omits an ongoing motion."}, {"quote":"this trunk travels leftward until it exits the frame", "problem":"The foreground trunk moves leftward toward the edge but is still visible near the frame edge by the final view; its exit is not shown."}, {"quote":"its motion more pronounced than the background because it sits closer to the lens", "problem":"The relative motion is visible, but the causal explanation is unnecessary and not directly evidenced by the images."}, {"quote":"two cylindrical illuminated advertising displays, a warm street lamp and a parked dark car enter from the edge", "problem":"The darker building and parked car are already partly visible at the start; not all listed objects enter from the edge."}], "caption":"The video captures a nighttime urban street blanketed in piled snow. The camera is already shifting steadily rightward, so fixed objects drift leftward across the frame. On the left a brightly lit storefront glows with purple, blue and white neon, where dark silhouettes of pedestrians gather near the entrance and one figure walks leftward past the snowbank. A small bare tree, two yellow marker posts and a glowing blue diamond-shaped light sit in the middle ground.

A bare tree trunk stands in the right foreground. As the view shifts, this trunk travels leftward toward the frame edge, its motion more pronounced than the background's. The yellow posts likewise slide out of view. On the right a darker building with rows of windows, two cylindrical illuminated advertising displays, a warm street lamp and a parked dark car move toward the center, some entering from the edge. A red sign structure also appears near the right.

The lateral movement remains in progress throughout, with the neon-lit area now fully out of frame.", "length_note":""}
